{
  "file_id": "ID03546",
  "text_count": 227,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "��������*sigh* I got a Crest, but...",
      "_offset": 2390,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "We have no clue how to use it.",
      "_offset": 2427,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "Or how to \"raise them properly...\"",
      "_offset": 2458,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "But we still haven't found all the\nCrests yet.",
      "_offset": 2493,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "Let's wait until all of us have a\nCrest so that we can try and\nfigure this out.",
      "_offset": 2540,
      "_length": 79,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "Gryaaaaaaaaaaaaaah!!",
      "_offset": 2628,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "W-what's that?!",
      "_offset": 2649,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "It's Kuwagamon!",
      "_offset": 2665,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "Taichi!",
      "_offset": 2681,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "Watch out, Agumon!",
      "_offset": 2689,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "What should I do, Taichi?",
      "_offset": 2708,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "What should you...aaaagh!",
      "_offset": 2734,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "Agumon! Evolve! You need to\nevolve!",
      "_offset": 2760,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "But what if that doesn't work?\nWhat if he turns into something\nother than Greymon...?",
      "_offset": 2796,
      "_length": 85,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "Gshhhaaaaaaaah!!",
      "_offset": 2882,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "Come on, what are you doing?",
      "_offset": 2899,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "We're done fooooor!",
      "_offset": 2928,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "Pit Bomb!",
      "_offset": 2948,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "W-what just happened?",
      "_offset": 2958,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "Kuwagamon...",
      "_offset": 2980,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "Pi! You scrubs!",
      "_offset": 2993,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "...? Are you talking to me?",
      "_offset": 3009,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Are you okay, Taichi?",
      "_offset": 3037,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "What's this...weird thing?",
      "_offset": 3059,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "Aaaaah! You're Piccolomon!",
      "_offset": 3086,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "So cuuute!",
      "_offset": 3113,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "Piccolomon defeated Kuwagamon!",
      "_offset": 3124,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "Pi, pi, pi. Did you see the power\nof my magic?",
      "_offset": 3155,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "Huh...",
      "_offset": 3202,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "You're the Chosen Children, aren't\nyou? That was a really close call,\nit was painful to watch, pi!",
      "_offset": 3209,
      "_length": 98,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "Those Crests and Tags are just\nwasted on you, pi!",
      "_offset": 3308,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "This Digimon isn't cute at all.",
      "_offset": 3358,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "You Digimon are slacking off as\nwell, pi! You lack exertion and\nguts, pi!",
      "_offset": 3390,
      "_length": 73,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "I haaaaaate exerting myself!",
      "_offset": 3464,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "That's why, starting today, all of\nyou will be training under me, pi!",
      "_offset": 3493,
      "_length": 69,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "Training?",
      "_offset": 3563,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "Especially the two of you over\nthere!",
      "_offset": 3573,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "Me?",
      "_offset": 3611,
      "_length": 3,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "Me?",
      "_offset": 3615,
      "_length": 3,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "You two are severely afflicted,\npi! You'll be getting the super\nspecial training course, pi!",
      "_offset": 3619,
      "_length": 92,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "Okay, let's go, pi!",
      "_offset": 3712,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "What should we do?",
      "_offset": 3732,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "What kind of Digimon is he?",
      "_offset": 3751,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "He's fussy, but he's not a bad\nDigimon.",
      "_offset": 3779,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Doesn't seem to have a black gear,\neither.",
      "_offset": 3819,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "What should we do, Taichi?",
      "_offset": 3862,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "Hm, why not?",
      "_offset": 3889,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "Well then, it's decided!",
      "_offset": 3902,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "What are you doing? Hurry up and\nget over here, pi!",
      "_offset": 3927,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "Okaaaaaaay...",
      "_offset": 3979,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "That's my training camp, pi!",
      "_offset": 3993,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "We have to climb all the way up\n*there*?",
      "_offset": 4022,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "You know, Etemon is chasing us.",
      "_offset": 4063,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "We shouldn't be hanging around in\none place for too long.",
      "_offset": 4095,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "No need to worry, pi! My barrier\ncan't be seen from the outside,\npi!",
      "_offset": 4153,
      "_length": 68,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "Are you sure we'll be okay?",
      "_offset": 4222,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "We'll just have to believe him for\nnow.",
      "_offset": 4250,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "Are we really gonna have to climb\nthat? No way...",
      "_offset": 4290,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "Don't give up, Mimi!",
      "_offset": 4340,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "*pant, pant*",
      "_offset": 4361,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "*pant, pant*",
      "_offset": 4374,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "You sound tired, Mimi...",
      "_offset": 4391,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "You should be ashamed of being\nexhausted so easily, pi!",
      "_offset": 4416,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "The first part of your training is\nto scrub this floor!",
      "_offset": 4472,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "S-scrub...?",
      "_offset": 4528,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "No waaaaaay!",
      "_offset": 4540,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "You two severely afflicted ones\nget the special menu! Tell me when\nyou're ready!",
      "_offset": 4553,
      "_length": 80,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "Got it.",
      "_offset": 4634,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "Ready? Let's start the training.",
      "_offset": 4642,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "Are we gonna be okay...?",
      "_offset": 4675,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "Hang in there, Taichi!",
      "_offset": 4700,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "You'll be fine, Agumon!",
      "_offset": 4723,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "Aaah, it's completely dark.",
      "_offset": 4747,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "What are we supposed to be doing\nin this cave? We can't see a\nthing.",
      "_offset": 4775,
      "_length": 68,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "At the back of this cave, there's\nsomething important you need to\nrecover. That's the training, pi!",
      "_offset": 4844,
      "_length": 99,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "Something important?",
      "_offset": 4944,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "That's it? Explain a little\nbetter!",
      "_offset": 4965,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "Go look for it. That's your\ntraining!",
      "_offset": 5001,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "Piccolomon's not giving us any\ntraining, just a bunch of\nconfusing riddles!",
      "_offset": 5039,
      "_length": 75,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "Is this one of those things we're\nsupposed to be figuring out once\nwe get there?",
      "_offset": 5115,
      "_length": 80,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "Well, we don't have any other\nchoice but to try, so let's go.",
      "_offset": 5196,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "Taichi, look!",
      "_offset": 5258,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "A treasure chest! This must be\nwhat Piccolomon was talking about!",
      "_offset": 5272,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "I wonder what's inside.",
      "_offset": 5338,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "He said it was something\nimportant, but it doesn't look\nlike much from here.",
      "_offset": 5362,
      "_length": 76,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "Aaaah!",
      "_offset": 5439,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "What's happening?! My feet are\nsinking into the ground!",
      "_offset": 5446,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "Taichiiiiii!!",
      "_offset": 5502,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "Agumooooooon!",
      "_offset": 5516,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "Zzz...",
      "_offset": 5530,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "Zzz... Zzz...",
      "_offset": 5537,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "Koushirou, have you seen Taichi?",
      "_offset": 5551,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "No, Taichi and Agumon haven't\nreturned.",
      "_offset": 5584,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "I wonder if they're okay...",
      "_offset": 5624,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "I'm worried...",
      "_offset": 5652,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "My Tag is glowing.",
      "_offset": 5673,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "Mine is, too!",
      "_offset": 5692,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "Our Crests must be nearby!",
      "_offset": 5706,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "english": "Let's go find them!",
      "_offset": 5733,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "_offset": 5753,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "english": "Where ya goin', guys?",
      "_offset": 5759,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "english": "You're not gonna leave without us,\nare you?",
      "_offset": 5781,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "english": "Gabumon!",
      "_offset": 5825,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "english": "You weren't sleeping either,\nTentomon?",
      "_offset": 5834,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "english": "Got woken up by your Tag all\nshinin'.",
      "_offset": 5873,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "english": "You're gonna go find the Crests,\nright? Take us with you!",
      "_offset": 5911,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "english": "Okay.",
      "_offset": 5969,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "english": "We'll go look for them. It should\nbe easier if the four of us\ncombine our efforts.",
      "_offset": 5975,
      "_length": 82,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "english": "When you consider where the Tag\nstarted shining from, it should be\nsomewhere in this direction.",
      "_offset": 6058,
      "_length": 95,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "english": "My Tag started shining there too.",
      "_offset": 6154,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "english": "So, why don't we go on a little\njungle expedition?",
      "_offset": 6188,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "english": "Yes!",
      "_offset": 6239,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "english": "Still, I wonder why both our Tags\nreacted at the same time?",
      "_offset": 6244,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "english": "I think I know why.",
      "_offset": 6304,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "english": "Just focus on finding the Crests.",
      "_offset": 6324,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "english": "The Crests fell together when they\nwere scattered around the\ncontinent.",
      "_offset": 6358,
      "_length": 71,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
